guard:wasm label_response input JSON (220010 bytes): {"capabilities":{},"tool_args":{"order":"asc","perPage":30,"query":"repo:apache/cloudstack is:open is:issue","sort":"created"},"tool_name":"search_issues","tool_result":{"content":[{"text":"{\"total_count\":650,\"incomplete_results\":false,\"items\":[{\"id\":364540980,\"number\":2865,\"state\":\"open\",\"locked\":false,\"title\":\"DNS records for additional local IP addresses\",\"body\":\"##### ISSUE TYPE\\r\\n * Feature Idea\\r\\n\\r\\n##### COMPONENT NAME\\r\\n* DNS\\r\\n\\r\\n##### CLOUDSTACK VERSION\\r\\n/\\r\\n\\r\\n##### CONFIGURATION\\r\\n* for customer isolated network\\r\\n\\r\\n##### OS / ENVIRONMENT\\r\\n/\\r\\n\\r\\n##### SUMMARY\\r\\nFor adaptive computing it's important to get use of additional application local IP addresses which you can move between machines in case of a failure of one of the virtual machines or for upgrades.\\r\\n\\r\\nI can attach an additional IP to a VM using ACS. But I cannot give that a separate name which does not belong to the actual hostname of the VM.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\\r\\n* possibility to add a DNS name for the additional local IP address\\r\\n* possibility to move an IP from one system to another (no delete and recreate - IP could be taken in the steps between)\\r\\n\\r\\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\\r\\n* currently the additional IP resolves into the same name as the original IP which is the hostname\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"IngoJochim\",\"id\":38244286,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjQ0Mjg2\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38244286?v=4\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/IngoJochim\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"type\":\"User\",\"site_admin\":false,\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/IngoJochim\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/IngoJochim/events{/privacy}\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/IngoJochim/following{/other_user}\",\"follo